WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.848 --> 00:00:06.430
- [Wanda] When you put on
a hat, it gives you height,

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.559
and it gives you power.

00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:12.218
- [Evetta] For us, church
hats are not just hats.

00:00:12.218 --> 00:00:15.539
They are crowns, and
when a woman puts one on,

00:00:15.539 --> 00:00:17.424
she becomes a queen.

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:20.007
(upbeat music)

00:00:26.132 --> 00:00:28.911
(funky music)

00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:31.351
- My name is Evetta Petty.

00:00:31.351 --> 00:00:32.724
- I'm Kathy Anderson.

00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:34.891
- And I am Wanda Chambers.

00:00:35.885 --> 00:00:39.718
We've been making hats
for more than 20 years.

00:00:40.959 --> 00:00:43.845
- A church hat is a very special hat.

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:46.968
Especially in the African
American community.

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:51.037
As a child growing up in
the south, in the 60s,

00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:52.824
we always wore hats.

00:00:52.824 --> 00:00:56.976
Sunday is the one day,
historically, that we had a chance,

00:00:56.976 --> 00:00:59.893
and we step out in our Sunday best.

00:01:02.897 --> 00:01:03.730
(upbeat music)

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.897
- I don't believe that church
hats are a thing of the past.

00:01:11.126 --> 00:01:14.969
I have noticed that the
younger generation is taking

00:01:14.969 --> 00:01:17.547
on the tradition of wearing hats.

00:01:17.547 --> 00:01:20.691
It makes me happy to see
a younger woman with a hat

00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:24.257
on her head because I know
that she's still carrying

00:01:24.257 --> 00:01:25.674
on the tradition.

00:01:28.426 --> 00:01:30.872
(upbeat music)

00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:33.515
- I come from a long line
of church hat wearing women.

00:01:33.515 --> 00:01:35.394
Everyone wore a hat.

00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:39.144
It was a parade, it was
colors, it was magic.

00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:47.554
- When you go to church and
you step in, and you see all

00:01:47.554 --> 00:01:51.721
of your sisters wear hats on,
we all be eyeing each other

00:01:53.127 --> 00:01:55.902
and under our breaths
saying, boy, that's a

00:01:55.902 --> 00:01:57.329
really gorgeous hat.

00:01:57.329 --> 00:02:01.496
So it's wonderful to be in
a room filled with women

00:02:02.028 --> 00:02:03.589
with hats on.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:06.763
And each one of us look absolutely amazing

00:02:06.763 --> 00:02:08.397
in our own right.

00:02:08.397 --> 00:02:10.980
(upbeat music)

